[
  {"comment": "Two overlapping bodies: Body1 60 x 40 x 20 at the origin (F2) and Body2 20 x 20 x 20 at (50, 30) (F4); they share 10 x 10 x 20 mm."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F3", "corner": [50, 30], "width": 20, "height": 20},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 2}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "interference"},
    "result": {"bodies": 2, "pairs": [{"a": "F2.b0", "b": "F4.b0", "volume": 2000, "names": ["Body1", "Body2"]}]}}},

  {"comment": "Sections at z = 10, by an explicit plane and by a construction plane."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "section", "plane": {"origin": [0, 0, 10], "normal": [0, 0, 1]}},
    "result": {"area": 2800, "length": 280,
      "bodies": [{"uid": "F2.b0", "faces": 1, "edges": 4, "area": 2400}, {"uid": "F4.b0", "faces": 1, "area": 400}]}}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "construction_plane", "definition": {"type": "offset", "plane": "xy", "distance": 10}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "section", "plane": "F5", "bodies": ["F4.b0"]},
    "result": {"plane": {"origin": [0, 0, 10], "normal": [0, 0, 1]}, "area": 400}}},

  {"comment": "Physical properties: steel by default, aluminium for Body2."},
  {"cmd": "set_body_material", "uid": "F4.b0", "material": "aluminum"},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "properties"}, "result": {
    "bodies": [
      {"uid": "F2.b0", "material": "steel", "density": 7.85, "volume": 48000, "mass": 0.3768,
       "center_of_mass": [30, 20, 10], "inertia": [[62.8, 0, 0], [0, 125.6, 0], [0, 0, 163.28]]},
      {"uid": "F4.b0", "material": "aluminum", "density": 2.7, "volume": 8000, "mass": 0.0216,
       "center_of_mass": [60, 40, 10]}],
    "total": {"mass": 0.3984, "volume": 56000}}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "properties", "bodies": ["F2.b0"], "densities": {"F2.b0": 1}},
    "result": {"bodies": [{"material": null, "mass": 0.048}]}}},
  {"comment": "Physical Properties' boxes along the design's axes and the bodies' faces, edges and vertices, each and in total, with the total area (mitcad#1095)."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "properties"}, "tolerance": 1e-6, "result": {
    "bodies": [
      {"uid": "F2.b0", "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [60, 40, 20], "size": [60, 40, 20]},
       "faces": 6, "edges": 12, "vertices": 8},
      {"uid": "F4.b0", "bbox": {"min": [50, 30, 0], "max": [70, 50, 20], "size": [20, 20, 20]},
       "faces": 6, "edges": 12, "vertices": 8}],
    "total": {"area": 11200, "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [70, 50, 20], "size": [70, 50, 20]},
      "faces": 12, "edges": 24, "vertices": 16}}}},

  {"comment": "Hiding a body is an attribute; the analysis still sees it."},
  {"cmd": "set_body_visible", "uid": "F2.b0", "visible": false},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "bodies"}, "result": [
    {"uid": "F2.b0", "name": "Body1", "visible": false},
    {"uid": "F4.b0", "name": "Body2", "material": "aluminum"}]}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": "origin", "b": "Body2"},
    "result": {"a": {"kind": "vertex", "point": [0, 0, 0]}, "between": {"distance": 58.309518948453004}}}},

  {"comment": "Print Analysis (mitcad#620) on the kernel's meshes: Body2 on its bottom and on its top as the bed face prints without overhangs, its walls are 20 mm, and the estimate of a 20 mm cube in PLA with the defaults."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "print_overhangs", "bodies": ["F4.b0"]},
    "result": {"down": [0, 0, -1], "overhang_area": 0, "area": 2400,
      "bodies": [{"body": "F4.b0", "name": "Body2", "share": 0, "triangles": []}]}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "print_overhangs", "bodies": ["F4.b0"],
      "bed_face": {"body": "F4.b0", "face": "F4:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"}},
    "result": {"down": [0, 0, 1], "overhang_area": 0}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "print_thickness", "bodies": ["F4.b0"]},
    "result": {"thinnest": 20, "bodies": [{"body": "F4.b0", "regions": 0, "triangles": []}]}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "print_estimate", "bodies": ["F4.b0"], "material": "pla"},
    "result": {"volume": 8000, "area": 2400, "shell_volume": 1920, "infill_volume": 912,
      "filament_volume": 2832, "mass": 3.51168, "material": "PLA Plastic", "density": 1.24, "cost": null}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "print_estimate", "bodies": ["F4.b0"], "material": "pla"},
    "result": {"length": 1.17741}, "tolerance": 1e-4}},

  {"comment": "A sphere of 20 mm on its lowest point: the cap within 45 degrees of straight down overhangs, (1 - sin 45°) / 2 of its area, to the mesh's accuracy; its walls are its diameter."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sphere", "plane": "xy", "center": [100, 0], "diameter": 20, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "print_overhangs", "bodies": ["F6.b0"], "deviation": 0.01},
    "result": {"share": 0.1464}, "tolerance": 0.02}},
  {"comment": "Its walls along the surface's normal: a ray from a facet through the centre to the facet opposite, both within the 0.01 mm deviation inside the sphere, so 20 mm less 0.02 mm and the little a ray misses the centre by (a chord d beside it is d² / 10 mm short): 0.0025 of 20 mm, 0.05 mm. Along the facets' own normals, skewed facets of the sphere's mesh gave chords beside the centre, 19.74 mm."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "print_thickness", "bodies": ["F6.b0"], "deviation": 0.01},
    "result": {"thinnest": 20, "bodies": [{"regions": 0}]}, "tolerance": 0.0025}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "print_estimate", "bodies": ["F6.b0"], "material": "pla"},
    "result": {"volume": 4188.790204786391, "area": 1256.6370614359173,
      "filament_volume": 1482.8317324943824, "mass": 1.8387113482930342}, "tolerance": 1e-5}}
]
